{
 "tickets": [
  {
   "body": "Dr. Smith's schedule is showing wrong working hours for next week. Please fix it.",
   "id": "gen-391",
   "subject": "Incorrect provider hours"
  },
  {
   "body": "I am completely lost here. I tried to change a prescription for a patient because their pharmacy called saying the drug is unavailable, but when I selected the alternative medication from the drop-down menu and clicked transmit, it somehow sent the original out-of-stock medication anyway to a completely different location downtown instead of their local branch. Now the pharmacy queue shows a weird error code I've never seen before, and I don't know if the patient is going to end up with two different scripts or none at all. Can someone please look at this right away and tell me how to cancel whatever just went through?",
   "id": "gen-392",
   "subject": "Prescription went to wrong pharmacy / wrong medication sent"
  },
  {
   "body": "Dear Support Team, we are currently onboarding several new individuals into our practice management environment and require assistance regarding patient portal access. Specifically, a few patients are experiencing difficulties while attempting to establish their initial online accounts or requiring administrative password resets. Could you please provide guidance on how our administrative staff can securely unlock these accounts and facilitate their onboarding process? Thank you for your assistance.",
   "id": "gen-393",
   "subject": "Assistance Required for Patient Portal Account Creation and Resets"
  },
  {
   "body": "How do we add patients to the cancellation waitlist so the system automatically notifies the next person when an opening pops up?",
   "id": "gen-394",
   "subject": "Waitlist automation"
  },
  {
   "body": "This directory system is driving me crazy. I've spent the last twenty minutes trying to find a newly opened pharmacy for a patient because their old one shut down, but every time I type the name into the search bar, nothing comes up or it gives me an error. I even tried looking up the zip code and scrolling through the list manually with no luck. How on earth do we add a custom pharmacy entry manually so I can finish sending this chart out?",
   "id": "gen-395",
   "subject": "Cannot find pharmacy in directory / need custom entry"
  },
  {
   "body": "I am beyond frustrated trying to figure out why half of our insurance claims from last Tuesday were denied. I've been clicking through the billing module trying to find where we are supposed to attach the supporting clinical notes for these specific denial codes, but the interface keeps looping me back to the main dashboard. We need to get these appeals filed before the deadline this week, so please let me know how to fix this immediately.",
   "id": "gen-396",
   "subject": "Cannot attach documents for denied claims"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, I am writing to inquire about the standard procedure for reviewing and signing off on incoming lab results within the software. Could you please clarify the exact steps required to annotate these documents before filing them, and advise on how we can properly route abnormal results to covering physicians when the primary provider is out of office? Thank you.",
   "id": "gen-397",
   "subject": "Procedure for reviewing labs and routing abnormal results"
  },
  {
   "body": "We need to swap a medication due to a stock shortage. Can you point us to the right messaging workflow for pharmacy substitutions?",
   "id": "gen-398",
   "subject": "Medication substitution workflow"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, I am so sorry to bother you with this, but I am having trouble making sure our compliance archive settings and data backup schedules are configured properly for our business associate agreements. I tried navigating through the security settings tab, but I got overwhelmed by all the options and didn't want to break anything. Could someone please walk me through how to set the daily backups correctly and also help me figure out how we can pull historical data exports if we ever need them for an audit?",
   "id": "gen-399",
   "subject": "Help with backup configuration and compliance archive"
  },
  {
   "body": "I'm not quite sure where to click to send out the monthly billing statements to patients, or how to change the reminder text on them. Could someone help?",
   "id": "gen-400",
   "subject": "Monthly billing statements and templates"
  }
 ]
}
